      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In this review the Author expose the most common gastroenterological problems in pediatric practice. The following illnesses are examined: infantile colics, recurrent abdominal pain, gastroesophageal reflux, vomiting, alimentary intolerances, coeliac disease, malabsorption syndromes, hepatic pathologies, acute diarrhoea, persistent postenteric diarrhoea, chronic constipation. For all problems are provided the actual indications of diagnosis and therapy on the basis of modern literature suggestions."},
